sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Owner
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant I as Program issue
    participant W as Worker (one per unit)
    participant V as Verifier (other model family)
    participant G as GitHub
    O->>C: "Deliver A, B and C in parallel"
    C->>O: Agree outcomes, criteria and open decisions
    C->>I: coord.py init and add units
    C->>W: coord.py launch: own workspace, brief, model by tier
    W->>I: report running, then in-review with its PR
    C->>I: coord.py sync reads reports and real PR state
    C->>V: launch a verify unit on the PR branch
    V->>C: re-run checks at the latest commit, recommend a verdict
    C->>G: coord.py verdict posts the jfactory verified verdict
    C->>G: coord.py merge queues auto-merge on the verified commit
    G-->>C: merged
    C->>W: dependent units update from main and re-check
    C->>I: coord.py close archives workspaces and closes the program
